{
  "name": "AI Voice Agent - Vapi Only (Free Vapi Number + Human Transfer)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Voice Agent (Vapi-only, no Twilio)\nYour free **Vapi phone number** sends every call event to **Vapi Server URL**.\n1. **assistant-request** (phone rings): n8n builds the AI receptionist and returns it to Vapi. The caller presses 1 or 2 (or just says \"support\" or \"sales\").\n2. **transfer-update**: Vapi warm-transfers the caller to your human number and n8n logs it.\n3. **end-of-call-report**: n8n receives the summary and transcript (connect a CRM or Google Sheet here).",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 1560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c0127bbb-cf3b-49fb-a523-3ee147fd30b1",
      "name": "Note: How it works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -460
      ]
    },
